    <name>Threshold L06A - 2x15 @ 97%</name>
    <description>Threshold - level 6 of 10, variant A. 2x15 @ 97%.

Structure: 10 min warm-up, 15 min @ 97%, 5 min @ 55%, 15 min @ 97%, 10 min @ 60%, 5 min cool-down.

Coach notes: Two 15-minute blocks. Time-trial pacing: the first 5 minutes feel easy.

Estimated TSS: 65.</description>
